hov-qt (1.2.1-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Release 1.2.1 for Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute):
    - download panel: byte-accurate progress, per-item cancel, cancel all,
      retry failed, open downloads folder, LRU cleanup drops finished rows
    - favorites panel and local library parity with macOS/Linux UI
    - window geometry persistence (first run 1200x720 centered)
    - picture-in-picture and playback fixes (stream URL recording, mux cancel)
    - launcher: LC_NUMERIC=C / QT_NO_GLIB=1 / ulimit -n 65535 kept intact

